Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 部分从课上的循环开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 starts with the lecture's loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:04.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,开发者把代码 commit 到代码库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Developers commit to the codebase.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:07.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着构建、测试：这是 CI 那一半\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is built and tested: that's the CI half.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:11.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后部署、监控：这是 CD 那一半\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it is deployed and monitored: the CD half.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:14.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个阶段都会把通知发回来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every stage sends notifications back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:18.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回顾部分的版本在测试和部署之间多加了一个方框\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The version in the review adds one box between test and deploy:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:23.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,发布，也就是把测试过的版本交出去部署的那一刻\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}release, the moment a tested version is handed over for deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:26.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,持续集成会在每次 push 时运行脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Continuous integration runs scripts on every push.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:29.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,很多开发者共享一个 repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Many developers share one repository,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:35.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个改动都要通过自动化测试、编码规范和静态分析\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and every change passes automated tests, coding standards, and static analysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:38.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,静态分析不用运行代码就能找出缺陷\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which finds defects without running code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:41.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你在第 9 讲和第 21 讲里搭过它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You built this in lectures 9 and 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:43.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是交付和部署\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then delivery and deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:49.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,持续交付让每个改动都随时可以发布，但按下按钮的是一个人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Continuous delivery keeps every change ready to release, but a person presses the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:53.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,持续部署会自己把每个通过的改动上线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Continuous deployment ships every passing change by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:00:55.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对机器学习来说\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For machine learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:01:00.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CI 还要检查数据质量和模型性能，所以成本很高\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CI also checks data quality and model performance, which makes it expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:05.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 CD 只有在指标处于容差范围内时才发布模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And CD releases a model only when its metrics are within a tolerance,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:07.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还必须应对数据漂移\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and must cope with data drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:11.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 部署的是应用，不是模型；模型是第 15 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This repo deploys an app, not a model; lecture 15 was the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在把这个 repo 放到循环上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now this repo on the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:16.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,构建、发布和部署亮了起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Build, release and deploy light up;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:20.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,发布就是带 tag 的 image 落进 ECR 的时候\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}release is when the tagged images land in ECR.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:21.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试这一格还是虚线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Test stays dashed:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:27.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个工作流叫持续集成和持续部署，却一个测试都不跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the workflow is named continuous integration and continuous deployment, but runs no test.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是 CD 那一半\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's the CD half.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:33.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而监控就是这次 run 的颜色，再加上你自己去网站上看一看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And monitor is the color of the run, plus your own check of the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:36.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上列了好几个 CI/CD 服务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture names several CI/CD services;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.95,0:01:42.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这门课用的是 GitHub Actions，构建部署 container 并运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the course uses GitHub Actions, to build the deployment container and run it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:44.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在每一个提出要求的 commit 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on every commit that asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:49.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,工作流文件保持得很薄；部署逻辑就是你刚刚跑过的那些 playbook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The workflow file stays thin; the deploy logic is the playbooks you just ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:55.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个工作流文件 ci cd aws.yml 不在 README 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The workflow file, ci_cd_aws.yml, isn't in the README,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.73,0:01:59.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这个进度条上的每一步都是额外的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so every step on this tracker is extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:01.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次 push 到 main 它都会启动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It starts on every push to main,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:05.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但这个 job 只在 commit 信息包含 /run- 时才运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the job runs only if the commit message contains /run-.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.13,0:02:09.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而最后一步，Run Deployment Container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the last step, Run Deployment Container,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:14.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对同一条信息有它自己的条件：必须包含 /run-deploy-app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}has its own condition on the same message: it must contain /run-deploy-app.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:16.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两道筛子，一句话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two sieves, one sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:19.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条信息 update readme 里没有 /run-\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The message update readme has no /run-,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:22.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这个 job 被跳过，什么都不运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the job is skipped and nothing runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:27.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,轮到你了。你把 fix typo /run-tests push 到 main\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your turn. You push fix typo /run-tests to main.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:30.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都不发生，只构建和 push，还是完整部署？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing, build and push only, or a full deploy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:40.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只构建和 push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Build and push only.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:45.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它通过了第一道筛子，所以 runner 构建三个新 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It passes the first sieve, so the runner builds three new images
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:48.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再 push 到 ECR，在那里它们会产生存储费用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and pushes them to ECR, where they cost storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:52.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它停在了第二道筛子，所以服务器还是用旧的 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It stops at the second sieve, so the server keeps the old tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:55.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,/run-deploy-app 两道筛子都能通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}/run-deploy-app passes both sieves:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:59.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有新的 image，服务器上的 container 也会被重新创建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}new images, and the containers on the server are recreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那开头那个 commit 呢？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the commit from the opening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:03.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的斜杠是反斜杠\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its slash is a backslash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:08.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面没有 /run- 这段文字，所以它在第一道筛子就被弹了回去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The text /run- isn't in it, so it bounces off the first sieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.34,0:03:09.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是那一个字符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the one character.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.05,0:03:12.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,教程那一页课件说的也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial slide says the same:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:15.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,.github/workflows 里的一个工作流文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a workflow file in .github/workflows,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上 commit 信息里的一个关键词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a keyword in the commit message.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:22.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的关键词 /deploy-app 属于 Google Cloud 那个 repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its keyword, /deploy-app, belongs to the Google Cloud repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:24.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里是 /run-deploy-app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here it's /run-deploy-app.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.97,0:03:30.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所谓 head commit，指的是一次 push 里的最后一个 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}head_commit means the last commit of a push,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:33.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以三个 commit 只按最后一条信息来判断\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so three commits are judged by the last message only.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:34.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且匹配不区分大小写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the match ignores case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:39.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 部分需要你自己的 GitHub repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 needs your own GitHub repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，建一个空的私有 repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, create an empty private one,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:43.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 origin 指向它，再 push main\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}point origin at it, and push main.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:48.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它最后一条信息里没有 /run-，所以暂时什么都不会运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its last message has no /run-, so nothing runs yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:52.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先把你的 secret 交给 GitHub：在你的 repo 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, give GitHub your secrets: in your repository,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:55.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开 Settings，Secrets and variables，Actions\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Settings, Secrets and variables, Actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:04:00.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加四个：访问密钥 ID、私有访问密钥、你的账号 ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Add four: the access key ID, the secret key, your account ID,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:03.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 AWS SSH key，也就是整个 pem 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and AWS_SSH_KEY, the whole pem file.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些名字来自工作流文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The names come from the workflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的徽章现在有了第三份副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your badge has a third copy now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:10.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 GitHub 上的保险库里，你的钥匙也有了第二份\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in a vault on GitHub, and your key a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:13.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每多一份副本，就多一个要保护的地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every copy is one more place to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:16.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 runner 是一台全新的 Ubuntu 机器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The runner is a fresh Ubuntu machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:21.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个来自 AWS 的 action，用两个 secret 配好它的凭据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An action from AWS sets up its credentials from two secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:24.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后它检查自己的身份，列出 S3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it checks who it is, lists S3,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.07,0:04:27.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再让 Docker 登录你的 ECR registry\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and logs Docker in to your ECR registry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:31.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后它用 commit 进去的 Dockerfile 构建同一个工具箱容器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it builds the same toolbox, from the committed Dockerfile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:34.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以第 1 部分对 Helm 的修复，要放进你的 commit 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So the Helm fix from part 1 belongs in your commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:38.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们没测试过：runner 会不会遇到同样的证书错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We didn't test whether runners hit the same certificate error.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:42.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来，用日期生成一个新的 tag，写进 .docker-tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, a fresh tag from the date, written to .docker-tag
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:45.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也写进一个 GitHub 在步骤之间保留的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and to a file GitHub keeps between steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.79,0:04:48.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,手动跑一下，它给出的是一个时间戳\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run by hand, it gives a timestamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:53.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后对前端就是普通的 docker build、docker tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then plain docker build, docker tag and docker push for the frontend,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:55.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和 docker push，另外两个 image 也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the same for the other two images.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:59.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 CI 里，构建应用 image 的是 runner，不是 playbook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In CI, the runner builds the app images, not the playbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.87,0:05:01.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以工具箱容器只负责部署\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So the toolbox only deploys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:05.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和你的笔记本相比：同一个工具箱容器，同一个 socket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compared with your laptop: same toolbox, same socket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:09.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但 deployment 目录在 /deployment\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But the deployment folder sits at /deployment,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:13.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥在 /root/.ssh，也没有应用目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the keys at /root/.ssh, and no app folders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:17.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后是 SSH 密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last, the SSH key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:21.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一步写出一份 SSH 配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The step writes an SSH config,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:26.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把你的密钥写成 ac215_2024.pem，权限 600\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and your key as ac215_2024.pem, with mode 600.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:29.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它把两个文件都拷进 deployment 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It copies both into the deployment folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只在 runner 上，从不 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on the runner only, never committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:39.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,部署这一步在 runner 上运行工具箱容器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The deploy step runs the toolbox on the runner,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:43.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,带上 socket、两个目录和五个环境变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with the socket, two folders, and five environment variables,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中就有 Docker tag 变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}DOCKER_TAG among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:49.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面是一长串命令：修好权限，登录 ECR\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside, one long command: fix permissions, log in to ECR,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:53.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用新 tag 运行 deploy-setup-containers\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}run deploy-setup-containers with the new tag,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:55.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再运行 deploy-setup-webserver\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then deploy-setup-webserver.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:58.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每一环只有在前一环成功时才运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each link runs only if the one before succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:03.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,手动跑一下，作为额外步骤，它打印出 tag，列出密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run by hand, as an extra, it prints the tag and lists the key,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:07.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后在 ECR 登录这一步，因为我们的占位密钥停了下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then stops at the ECR login with our placeholder key.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个 playbook 都没有运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Neither playbook runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:11.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跟着一个 tag 走\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Follow one tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:13.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,日期在 runner 上给它盖上时间戳\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The date stamps it on the runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:16.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它作为 extra vars 进入 Ansible\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It reaches Ansible as an extra variable,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:18.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,优先级高于 playbook 里设的任何值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which beats anything the playbook sets,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:22.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以服务器会按这个 tag pull 那三个 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the server pulls the three images at that tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:24.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后每个 container 都被重新创建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then each container is recreated:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:28.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,旧的停掉，新的启动，中间有一小段空档\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the old one stops, the new one starts, with a short gap between.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:33.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件部署到一个 Kubernetes 集群上，在那里，和第 22 讲一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The slides deploy to a Kubernetes cluster, where, as in lecture 22,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:38.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,滚动更新会先启动新的 Pod，再让旧的离开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a rolling update starts new pods before the old ones go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.35,0:06:41.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一台机器只能直接替换；它滚动不起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One machine can only swap; it doesn't roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:42.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要 commit 四样东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Commit four things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你服务器的地址，填在第 30 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your server address on line 30:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:47.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CI 部署的是 commit 进去的任何东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CI deploys whatever is committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:50.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,撤销第 9 步：打开第 4 行，关掉第 7 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 9 undone: line 4 on, line 7 off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:52.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Helm 的修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Helm fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:54.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Chroma 的 pin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Chroma pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:58.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,执行 git add . 也会把你的账号 ID 和 NextAuth secret\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git add . also commits your account ID and NEXTAUTH_SECRET,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一起 commit 进去，所以 repo 要保持私有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so keep the repository private.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:05.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是课件上的三条命令，换上这个 repo 的关键词：git add .\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the slide's three commands, with this repo's keyword: git add .,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:09.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git commit -m 的信息里写上 /run-deploy-app，再 git push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git commit -m "…" with /run-deploy-app in the message, and git push.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and push.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:20.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次绿色的 run，意思是每个跑过的步骤都以 0 退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A green run means every step that ran exited with zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:21.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并不代表应用能用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not that the app works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:25.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,重新加载你的网站，再到服务器的 image 那一列里找新的 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Reload your site, and find the new tag in the server's image column.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:31.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用课上的话说：敲 /run-deploy-app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the lecture's words: is typing /run-deploy-app continuous delivery,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.07,0:07:32.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,算持续交付，还是持续部署？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}or continuous deployment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,怎样才能让它变成另一个？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What would make it the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:46.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,持续交付\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:51.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次发布都由一个人敲关键词来决定，而且之前什么都没测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A person decides each release by typing the keyword, and nothing is tested first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把每次合并到 main 都部署出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deploy every merge to main,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:59.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,前面挡着第 21 讲的测试，它就变成了持续部署\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}behind the tests from lecture 21, and it becomes continuous deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:00.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是 Milestone 5\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is Milestone 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:05.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回到 README，看它的最后一步：删除\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back to the README, for its last step: delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:06.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它跑的还是同一个 playbook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It runs the same playbook with cluster_state=absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:09.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只是 cluster state 设为 absent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It runs the same playbook with cluster_state=absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:10.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看看那些 when 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look at the when: lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:12.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这三个 task 里，哪些会运行？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which of these three tasks run?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.55,0:08:23.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,完全照着写的来跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run it exactly as written.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:25.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,安全组，skipping\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Security group, skipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,EBS volume，skipping\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}EBS volume, skipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:30.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后实例那个 task 没有 when 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the instance task has no when: line,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:32.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结果失败了：no attribute group ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and fails: no attribute group_id.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:35.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这发生在任何 AWS 调用之前\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is before any AWS call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:38.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,被跳过的 task 从来没有设好安全组\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The skipped task never set the security group,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:40.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以实例那个 task 被它绊倒了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the instance task trips over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:42.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就算过了这一关\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Even past that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:46.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删除还需要一个只有创建时才会 register 的 volume ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the removal needs a volume ID that only a create run registers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:49.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且没有任何 task 去终止实例\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and no task terminates the instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:51.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以要手动清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So clean up by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:56.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 EC2 控制台里，终止实例，然后删除那个 50 GB 的 volume\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the EC2 console, terminate the instance, then delete the 50 gigabyte volume,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:09:00.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,实例没了它还在，再删掉安全组和你的密钥对\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which outlives it, the security group and your key pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.28,0:09:04.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,成本是课上说的 CD 的挑战之一\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Cost is one of the lecture's challenges for CD,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:07.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而这台服务器会一直计费，直到你做完这些\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and this server bills until you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:10.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 ECR 里，删掉那三个仓库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In ECR, delete the three repositories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:13.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 IAM 里，先停用再删除访问密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In IAM, deactivate and delete the access key,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:17.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有用户和策略，如果它们只是为这一讲建的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the user and the policy if you made them only for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 GitHub 上，删掉那四个 secret\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On GitHub, delete the four secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:23.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的笔记本上，删掉工具箱容器的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On your laptop, remove the toolbox image,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:27.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,2.5 GB，你改过的文件可以留着，也可以恢复原样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}two and a half gigabytes, and keep or restore your edited files.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:37.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一讲最后是整门课的回顾，就在你部署的这台服务器上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture ends with a review of the course, on the server you deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:40.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,虚拟机和 container，第 1 讲和第 2 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Virtual machines and containers, lectures 1 and 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.11,0:09:43.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个共享的 bucket，第 3 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A shared bucket, lecture 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:46.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有那位资深开发者手动 push 的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the images the senior developer pushed by hand:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:48.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在由 runner 来 push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the runner pushes them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:54.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解决方案架构：前端和 API 负责执行；ECR 和磁盘保存状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The solution architecture: frontend and API execute; ECR and the disk hold state.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:58.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检索，第 5 讲，就是加载器和 Chroma\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Retrieval, lecture 5, is the loader and Chroma;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:10:00.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,agent，第 6 讲和第 7 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}agents, lectures 6 and 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:06.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,标注和微调不在这里：API 通过 Bedrock 调用现成的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Labeling and fine tuning aren't here: the API calls ready-made models through Bedrock,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:10.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上之前训练好的奶酪分类器，以文件的形式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus the cheese classifier trained earlier, as a file.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.83,0:10:15.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,训练和 pipeline，第 13 讲和第 15 讲，在这台服务器旁边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Training and pipelines, lectures 13 and 15, sit beside this server.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:19.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 和前端的 container，第 18 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The API and frontend containers, lecture 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:22.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CI 循环，第 9 讲和第 21 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The CI loop, lectures 9 and 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:28.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路由，第 20 讲和第 22 讲：就是今天的 nginx。下一步做什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Routing, lectures 20 and 22: today's nginx. Where next?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:33.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把第 21 讲的测试放在前面，再把每次合并到 main 都部署出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Put the tests from lecture 21 in front, and deploy every merge to main.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:35.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,替换掉这些复制来复制去的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Replace the copied keys:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:38.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给服务器一个角色，给 GitHub 用 OIDC\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a role for the server, and OIDC for GitHub.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:40.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上 HTTPS\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And add HTTPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:42.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再把这条路走一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Once more, the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:44.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你笔记本上的两份密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two secrets on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:47.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个用你笔记本上 Docker 的工具箱容器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A toolbox using your laptop's Docker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:51.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 localhost 上，或者通过 SSH 在服务器上运行的 play\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Plays on localhost, or on the server over SSH.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:55.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 tag，从 date 命令一直到重新创建的 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One tag, from the date command to a recreated container.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:57.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一句按下发布按钮的话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One sentence that presses release.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有手动清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And clean up by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:01.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:04.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一：说出那两份密钥，各自打开什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One: name the two secrets, what each opens,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:07.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及访问密钥最后会出现在哪三个地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and three places the access key ends up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:09.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,角色和 OIDC 能去掉什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What would a role and OIDC remove?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:13.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二：为什么 sh docker-shell.sh 在 Ubuntu 上失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two: why does sh docker-shell.sh fail on Ubuntu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:15.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Mac 上却能用？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but work on a Mac?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:18.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那条没加引号的 pip install 到底做了什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And what did that unquoted pip install actually do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三：localhost 的 play 里的 task 在哪里运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three: where do the tasks of a localhost play run,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:23.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,appserver 的 play 呢？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and of an appserver play?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:26.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么工具箱容器能把你笔记本的磁盘填满？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And why can the toolbox fill the disk of your laptop?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第四：跟着一个时间戳走\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four: follow one timestamp
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:31.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 date 命令一直走到一个运行中的 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from the date command to a running container.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:34.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器怎么在变量和文件之间做选择？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How does the server choose between the variable and the file?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第五：下面哪几个会触发部署？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five: which of these deploy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:40.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,四条信息分别是 update readme、fix typo /run-tests\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Update readme, fix typo /run-tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:45.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,大写的 /RUN-DEPLOY-APP，还有 \\run-deploy-app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}/RUN-DEPLOY-APP in capitals, and \\run-deploy-app.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，这条 pipeline 是持续交付还是持续部署？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And is this pipeline delivery or deployment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.28,0:11:50.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案在练习里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Answers are in the exercises.
